---
const IMG = '/illustrations';
const PUMP = 'https://pump.fun/coin/Ab16ce5SDbibTbXevxHLpqUnUvu9tNkkpaJcSDvCpump';
---
<div id="dim-future" class="page">
  <div class="f-grad"></div>
  <div class="future-hero">
    <canvas id="future-canvas"></canvas>
    <div class="f-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="f-scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="future-hero-text">
      <div class="f-tag rv">9 · Future · The Network</div>
      <h1 class="f-h1 rv d1">Free energy<br>for <em>everyone</em>.</h1>
      <p class="f-lead rv d2">No banks. No borders. Energy surging through the Earth itself to every point on the globe — wireless, instant, free. The answer Tesla never got to give.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-scenes">
    <div class="f-row rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/solana-globe.jpg`} alt="The signal, transmitted worldwide on Solana" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Conductor</p><h3 class="f-h3">One signal,<br>the <em>whole Earth</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">Tesla's tower became a network. The crystal in his hand is Solana — and the light reaching every city is the signal he was never allowed to send.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row flip rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/future-world-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Infrastructure</p><h3 class="f-h3">The network<br>already <em>exists</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">65,000+ TPS. $0.00025 fee. Sub-second finality. Tesla's dream — running on Solana right now.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/zero-tax.jpg`} alt="0% tax — fee $0.00025" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">Free For Everyone</p><h3 class="f-h3">No meter.<br><em>No middleman</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">0% tax. $0.00025 per transaction. The cost J.P. Morgan demanded a meter for — now small enough to be, effectively, free.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row flip rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/torch-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Signal Lives</p><h3 class="f-h3">They silenced the tower.<br>Not the <em>frequency</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">Owned by no one. Available to everyone. The frequency Wardenclyffe was built to transmit — now permanent on the blockchain.</p><div class="rm-list"><div class="rm-i rv"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Instant ⚡ZAPP payments at live events worldwide</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d1"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Humanitarian partnerships and NGO integrations</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d2"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Micro-grants — no bank, no middleman, no border</p></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-close rv"><span class="freq">3 · 6 · 9 ∞</span><h2>⚡ZAPP is the answer<br>Tesla never got to <em>give</em>.</h2><p>Decentralised. Borderless. Free for everyone. Forever.</p><button class="btn-future" data-hub style="cursor:pointer;margin-right:1rem">↩ Hub</button><a href={PUMP} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-future">Buy ⚡ZAPP</a></div>
</div>
